Codex is OpenAI's local coding agent CLI.

Runtime dependencies used by the codex binary:
  glibc
  libcap
  openssl
  sqlite
  dbus

Build dependencies for this package:
  rust and cargo (rustc 1.93 or newer)
  gcc/clang/llvm and git
  pkgconf, cmake, ninja, perl
  libcap, openssl, sqlite, dbus development files

Build notes:
  SLKBUILD forces /usr/bin/cargo and /usr/bin/rustc to avoid user rustup
  shims/toolchain auto-updates during package builds.

Optional upstream development tools not required to build codex:
  just (packaged as d/just)
  cargo-nextest (packaged as d/cargo-nextest)
  pnpm (packaged as d/pnpm, requires nodejs)
  nodejs and npm
